  "content": "<p>New blind boxes have materialized at Disneyland Resort, and they feature the ghostly characters of Haunted Mansion. These blind boxes are also available <a href=\"https://wdwnt.com/2026/09/haunted-mansion-blind-box-figurines-inspired-by-hitchhiking-ghosts-constance-hatchaway-and-more-coming-soon/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">online </a>and at <a href=\"https://wdwnt.com/2026/10/haunted-mansion-mystery-boxes-featuring-hatbox-ghost-hitchhiking-ghosts-and-more-arrive-at-disney-springs/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Walt Disney World</a>.</p><h2>Haunted Mansion Blind Box – $9.99</h2><figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-1-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Haunted Mansion Blind Box - $9.99\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-2-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-2-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Haunted Mansion Blind Box - $9.99\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure>\n</figure><p>The figures come in a purple box that is decorated with an allover pattern of the Haunted Mansion damask wallpaper pattern. The Hatbox Ghost is largely featured on one side of the box.</p>\n</figure><p>Each box contains one of six possible designs:</p><ul>\n<li>Constance Hatchaway</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hatbox Ghost</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Opera Singer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Phineas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gus</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ezra</li>\n</ul><p>There is an equal chance to get each figure. Discounts do not apply and there are no refunds, exchanges, or returns.</p><figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-4-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-4-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Haunted Mansion Blind Box - $9.99\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-5-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-5-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Haunted Mansion Blind Box - $9.99\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-6-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/10/dlr-dtd-storyland-boutique-haunted-mansion-blind-box-6-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Haunted Mansion Blind Box - $9.99\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure>\n</figure><p>A nearby display case shows the figures out of the box. They each have green skin and are primarily wearing either white or black. Any accessories they have are colored a dark purple. All figures are attached to a purple base outlined in black.</p><h2>Location</h2><figure><a href=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/07/dlr-dd-storyland-boutique-villains-added-to-sign-1-scaled.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://r2-media.wdwnt.com/2026/07/dlr-dd-storyland-boutique-villains-added-to-sign-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Storyland Boutique shop sign with a Maleficent-inspired &quot;S&quot; and a Queen of Hearts-inspired &quot;D.&quot;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" /></a></figure><p>We found the new blind boxes at the <a href=\"https://disneyland.disney.go.com/shops/downtown-disney-district/disney-storyland-boutique/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Disney Storyland Boutique</a> shop in Downtown Disney at Disneyland Resort. Storyland Boutique has been <a href=\"https://wdwnt.com/2026/07/disney-villains-take-over-storyland-boutique-shop-in-downtown-disney/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">rethemed with Disney Villains decor</a> for the Halloween season.</p><p>Which ghostly figure are you hoping will follow you home? Let us know on social media.</p><p>For more Disneyland Resort news and info, follow Disneyland News Today on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/dlnt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DisneylandNewsToday/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/disneylandnewstoday/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a>. For Disney Parks news worldwide, visit <a href=\"https://wdwnt.com/category/parks-resorts/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">WDWNT</a>.</p>"
